diff --git a/internal/api/AGENTS.md b/internal/api/AGENTS.md
index c9e3606..b279110 100644
--- a/internal/api/AGENTS.md
+++ b/internal/api/AGENTS.md
@@ -61,3 +61,17 @@ a sanctioned bypass of the worker boundary. Do not add others; see
   changes (a manual step, not a CI gate); use
   `npm run preview -- --host 127.0.0.1 --port <port>` from
   `internal/api/dashboardspa/web/frontend` after `make dashboard-build-npm`
+
+## Exact scoped metadata CAS
+
+`huma_metadata_cas.go` exposes the existing value-CAS via a required local
+`store_ref`. Reuse controller-owned handles and their capability probes; never
+open a per-request replacement or fall back to another store. False-CAS
+classification reads the same authoritative backing, not a cached projection.
+Keep explicit empty values, exact CLI-compatible receipts, unsupported refusal,
+and the ordinary mutation admission middleware. Capability GET is read-only.
+
+Metadata keys use the intersection of the scoped CLI token grammar and the
+pinned bd metadata grammar: `[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_.]{0,255}`. Reject keys
+outside that set before accessing a store. Revision tokens remain signed int64;
+a negative token is not evidence of overflow or a different storage authority.
